{"command": "captured artifact: preventive review outcome OCOR-DEV-REM-0050-0add4925070f-pre", "exit_code": 0, "label": "preventive-review-outcome", "output": "{\n  \"schema_version\": \"ocor-prereview-v1\",\n  \"request_id\": \"OCOR-DEV-REM-0050-0add4925070f-pre\",\n  \"unit\": \"OCOR-DEV-REM-0050\",\n  \"review_type\": \"REMEDIATION\",\n  \"branch\": \"governed/ocor-dev-rem-0050-ncp-u04-c3-commit-admission\",\n  \"base_sha\": \"84fb7e7aae69c78d3f22df42225399cd70822209\",\n  \"head_sha\": \"0add4925070f2f8f7703e4e08760a7070e027532\",\n  \"reviewer\": {\n    \"process\": \"Antigravity CLI\",\n    \"model\": \"gemini-4-argon-high\",\n    \"vendor\": \"Google\"\n  },\n  \"reserve_reviewer\": false,\n  \"independence_limit\": null,\n  \"outcome\": \"BLOCKING_FINDINGS\",\n  \"verdict\": \"BLOCKING_FINDINGS\",\n  \"blocking_findings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P1\",\n      \"category\": \"code_quality\",\n      \"file\": \"ocor-runtime/src/ocor_runtime/c8/adapters/postgres_ledger.py\",\n      \"lines\": \"71-134\",\n      \"clause\": \"PRE-REVIEW-INPUT-ROBUSTNESS (2026-10-29) punti 1, 2, 3, 4 e 5; AFF-002/AFF-006\",\n      \"problem\": \"Il nuovo adapter PostgreSQL PostgresRunLedger (introdotto in ocor-runtime/src/ocor_runtime/c8/adapters/postgres_ledger.py per NCR-C3-002) viola i requisiti obbligatori di PRE-REVIEW-INPUT-ROBUSTNESS (2026-10-29) sul confine esterno del database: (1) Stato del protocollo/trasporto ed eccezioni del driver: ne initialize() (righe 71-78), ne append() (righe 99-115), ne entries() (righe 129-134) intercettano psycopg.Error per tradurlo in RunLedgerError con reason_code esplicito (es. BACKEND_UNAVAILABLE / BACKEND_ERROR), lasciando propagare eccezioni grezze del driver fuori dall'adapter; inoltre in initialize(), se connection.execute(SCHEMA) solleva un errore SQL, il blocco finally esegue SELECT pg_advisory_unlock(...) sulla stessa transazione abortita (InFailedSqlTransaction), fallendo e mascherando l'eccezione originaria, e initialize() non